(5544971, 801294, 54645, '<td valign="top">The mood and emotion are palpable. Patiently waiting. The BW conversion and subsequent tone support the mood. For the most part, I like the composition, I wonder if it were possible to take a step camera right to free up the right chain from the background tree. (BTW, searched the galleries, plenty of children on swings, but this is unique. I''m hopeful your presentation and processing will keep the DNMC police away!) Good luck! 9</td>', 'The mood and emotion are palpable. Patiently waiting. The BW conversion and subsequent tone support the mood. For the most part, I like the composition, I wonder if it were possible to take a step camera right to free up the right chain from the background tree. (BTW, searched the galleries, plenty of children on swings, but this is unique. I''m hopeful your presentation and processing will keep the DNMC police away!) Good luck! 9', '2009-06-26 10:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
