(5545202, 801877, 52500, '<td valign="top">I don''t find the photo itself super amazing (the oof fence in front dominates the scene), but it''s damn funny!  It almost seems real, but the super shallow dof makes me think the whole thing is pretty small.  It has an indefinable toy-like quality to it as well.</td>', 'I don''t find the photo itself super amazing (the oof fence in front dominates the scene), but it''s damn funny!  It almost seems real, but the super shallow dof makes me think the whole thing is pretty small.  It has an indefinable toy-like quality to it as well.', '2009-06-26 13:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5545206, 802024, 52500, '<td valign="top">Great concept.  DPC certainly hasn''t ever seen that score (and probably never will!)</td>', 'Great concept.  DPC certainly hasn''t ever seen that score (and probably never will!)', '2009-06-26 13:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5545208, 802034, 52500, '<td valign="top">Lots of interesting stuff to look at!  I think I actually like it better with the stuff on the right cropped out.  Other than that, very cool look and certainly original!</td>', 'Lots of interesting stuff to look at!  I think I actually like it better with the stuff on the right cropped out.  Other than that, very cool look and certainly original!', '2009-06-26 13:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5545216, 801856, 52500, '<td valign="top">A lovely semi-recognizable abstract.  I really like the bits of rain, and the one bright sharp one is perfect.  I''m not as big a fun of the multi-color noise, though.  I probably would have turned this into a nice grainy duotone, myself.  In fact, I tossed the Nik Silver Efex Pro Soft Sepia preset on it and it looks fabulous.</td>', 'A lovely semi-recognizable abstract.  I really like the bits of rain, and the one bright sharp one is perfect.  I''m not as big a fun of the multi-color noise, though.  I probably would have turned this into a nice grainy duotone, myself.  In fact, I tossed the Nik Silver Efex Pro Soft Sepia preset on it and it looks fabulous.', '2009-06-26 13:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5545218, 801398, 102024, '<td valign="top">Hmm... with the title, I''d imagine this to be a little less serene and a little more gritty.  Perhaps if she was fastened to the hay in some way...</td>', 'Hmm... with the title, I''d imagine this to be a little less serene and a little more gritty.  Perhaps if she was fastened to the hay in some way...', '2009-06-26 13:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
