(5545279, 800472, 52130, '<td valign="top">hmm, what is that anyway? I found one of those in some dirt one time and took a pic of it on my finger (don''t worry, I didn''t post it on DPC though, so you''re safe) but obviously the magnification didn''t work as well as this using only my camera. nice job.</td>', 'hmm, what is that anyway? I found one of those in some dirt one time and took a pic of it on my finger (don''t worry, I didn''t post it on DPC though, so you''re safe) but obviously the magnification didn''t work as well as this using only my camera. nice job.', '2009-06-26 13:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
