(5545321, 801063, 57460, '<td valign="top">Ha ha!  I love the humor in this - I don''t think this has ever been seen on DPC!  Your neighbors must have been wondering what the hell you were doing! LOL!  But it does look like the lid is down - that will make for a messy cleanup!  I can''t stop laughing!</td>', 'Ha ha!  I love the humor in this - I don''t think this has ever been seen on DPC!  Your neighbors must have been wondering what the hell you were doing! LOL!  But it does look like the lid is down - that will make for a messy cleanup!  I can''t stop laughing!', '2009-06-26 14:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5545328, 802034, 57460, '<td valign="top">I really like the artistic aspect of this photo!  Great job!  I am trying to figure out what it is?  A reflection in a puddle of water, and the image reversed?  Wonderful artistic photo!</td>', 'I really like the artistic aspect of this photo!  Great job!  I am trying to figure out what it is?  A reflection in a puddle of water, and the image reversed?  Wonderful artistic photo!', '2009-06-26 14:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5545339, 802010, 57460, '<td valign="top">Ha!  I love this - they sure do look like queens! And very appropriate timing for me - during Gay Pride week here.  Great job!</td>', 'Ha!  I love this - they sure do look like queens! And very appropriate timing for me - during Gay Pride week here.  Great job!', '2009-06-26 14:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5545340, 802120, 57460, '<td valign="top">Goodness - that is a very interesting Egg Separator - hilarious!</td>', 'Goodness - that is a very interesting Egg Separator - hilarious!', '2009-06-26 14:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5545342, 801151, 57460, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot - I love the DOF in this one!  Great Job!</td>', 'Beautiful shot - I love the DOF in this one!  Great Job!', '2009-06-26 14:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5545346, 801479, 57460, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and simple!  I love the teapot silhouette and reflection!  Great job!</td>', 'Beautiful and simple!  I love the teapot silhouette and reflection!  Great job!', '2009-06-26 14:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5545350, 802076, 57460, '<td valign="top">Ha ha!  That sure is a corn dog!  Mmm, that actually kinda sounds good - I am vegan and always like to try weird combinations - maybe next time I will substitute my Tofu Dog for some Corn (not on the cob though - that would be hard to bite into!)  Great humor shot!  As far as the photo itself - maybe next time lay down some black felt or a table cloth.  I think the lighted wood in the bottom right had corner is a little distracting.  But the humor in the shot makes up for it!</td>', 'Ha ha!  That sure is a corn dog!  Mmm, that actually kinda sounds good - I am vegan and always like to try weird combinations - maybe next time I will substitute my Tofu Dog for some Corn (not on the cob though - that would be hard to bite into!)  Great humor shot!  As far as the photo itself - maybe next time lay down some black felt or a table cloth.  I think the lighted wood in the bottom right had corner is a little distracting.  But the humor in the shot makes up for it!', '2009-06-26 14:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5545351, 800800, 57460, '<td valign="top">Wow - beautiful, strong, emotional photo.  I love the look on her face - it looks more like hope, intrigue, contempt - not fear or sadness.  The C word is very dreaded but also very real for alot of people.  Great job!</td>', 'Wow - beautiful, strong, emotional photo.  I love the look on her face - it looks more like hope, intrigue, contempt - not fear or sadness.  The C word is very dreaded but also very real for alot of people.  Great job!', '2009-06-26 14:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5545352, 802094, 57460, '<td valign="top">Wow - ow, that almost makes me hurt looking at it - that poor lens!  I love your choice of title - it adds a lot of humor to it!</td>', 'Wow - ow, that almost makes me hurt looking at it - that poor lens!  I love your choice of title - it adds a lot of humor to it!', '2009-06-26 14:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5545356, 801955, 57460, '<td valign="top">Great macro!  I did not catch the fit to this challenge until I read your title - since there are many bug macros.  But with your title, I understand where you were going with it.  Great photo and great capture!</td>', 'Great macro!  I did not catch the fit to this challenge until I read your title - since there are many bug macros.  But with your title, I understand where you were going with it.  Great photo and great capture!', '2009-06-26 14:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
