(5545367, 801968, 60899, '<td valign="top">I dont know what it is ... but it looks amazing :D 9<br/>I guess this is a negative of some wires coming out of something in loop fashion</td>', 'I dont know what it is ... but it looks amazing :D 9I guess this is a negative of some wires coming out of something in loop fashion', '2009-06-26 14:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
