(5546039, 802121, 52130, '<td valign="top">I know I''ve seen baby birds in challenges before, and if I''m right, it looks similar to one user''s style of shooting baby birds in a vineyard. Aside from that, the lighting and colors are fantastic and I love that you can just barely see the pupil of the green eye. I don''t know what was available to you, but I might have done a horizontal orientation instead with the chick on the left to strengthen the idea that the bird is calling out to its mother. Just an opinion though, still a lovely photo.</td>', 'I know I''ve seen baby birds in challenges before, and if I''m right, it looks similar to one user''s style of shooting baby birds in a vineyard. Aside from that, the lighting and colors are fantastic and I love that you can just barely see the pupil of the green eye. I don''t know what was available to you, but I might have done a horizontal orientation instead with the chick on the left to strengthen the idea that the bird is calling out to its mother. Just an opinion though, still a lovely photo.', '2009-06-26 21:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
