(5546814, 801485, 86447, '<td valign="top">It''s not exactly a new subject <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=197190" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/353/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_197190.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/353/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_197190.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/353/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_197190.jpg"/></a>, but it''s rare here, for sure.  I wish the handles were more in focus... more DOF would help this really pop from the wonderful black background instead of receding into it, I think.   (not voting)</td>', 'It''s not exactly a new subject , but it''s rare here, for sure.  I wish the handles were more in focus... more DOF would help this really pop from the wonderful black background instead of receding into it, I think.   (not voting)', '2009-06-27 13:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5546817, 802132, 86447, '<td valign="top">Could use some brightness/contrast to help this otherwise interesting and fun image, I think.   The whites need to be white and fully contrasting with the colors. (not voting)</td>', 'Could use some brightness/contrast to help this otherwise interesting and fun image, I think.   The whites need to be white and fully contrasting with the colors. (not voting)', '2009-06-27 13:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5546822, 802009, 86447, '<td valign="top">It''s unusual, for sure. <br/> <br/>It''s also an interesting piece of architecture.  I think, though, for the image to be really interesting, the subject should be offset to one side or the other, not centered, to really grab the viewer.  Also, adding in a human would give it scale and even more interest, I think.   (not voting)</td>', 'It''s unusual, for sure.  It''s also an interesting piece of architecture.  I think, though, for the image to be really interesting, the subject should be offset to one side or the other, not centered, to really grab the viewer.  Also, adding in a human would give it scale and even more interest, I think.   (not voting)', '2009-06-27 13:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5546826, 802082, 86447, '<td valign="top">LOL... I like the title trying to confuse the viewer.  <br/> <br/>I wish the focus weren''t off on the left side... just a tad bit more DOF would have been better, I think.   That would also take care of the noise on the left and lower left corner.   (not voting)</td>', 'LOL... I like the title trying to confuse the viewer.   I wish the focus weren''t off on the left side... just a tad bit more DOF would have been better, I think.   That would also take care of the noise on the left and lower left corner.   (not voting)', '2009-06-27 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
