(5546877, 802078, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is a good sharp image.  I''m not good at photographing wildlife, it''s very difficult, but I think what separates this one, from the ones that are ribbon-winners is that this one seems to be caught in an awkward moment... like half step of movement. <br/> <br/>Also, the background is cluttered and distrating.  Getting the right balance of isolating the subject, yet still keepint it all sharp is very difficult, I''m sure.  <br/> <br/>This one <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=109793" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/262/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_109793.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/262/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_109793.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/262/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_109793.jpg"/></a> used the background  to set it off and the animal feels still and not awkward to me. Keep at it.  Noone starts out getting perfect wildlife shots.   (not voting)</td>', 'This is a good sharp image.  I''m not good at photographing wildlife, it''s very difficult, but I think what separates this one, from the ones that are ribbon-winners is that this one seems to be caught in an awkward moment... like half step of movement.  Also, the background is cluttered and distrating.  Getting the right balance of isolating the subject, yet still keepint it all sharp is very difficult, I''m sure.   This one  used the background  to set it off and the animal feels still and not awkward to me. Keep at it.  Noone starts out getting perfect wildlife shots.   (not voting)', '2009-06-27 13:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5546878, 802066, 64989, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this more if the crop included more height.</td>', 'I think I would have liked this more if the crop included more height.', '2009-06-27 13:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
