(5546900, 802051, 64989, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.  The way the fronds of the roof come donw on the walls, I''m reminded of a shaggy haircut.</td>', 'This is very nice.  The way the fronds of the roof come donw on the walls, I''m reminded of a shaggy haircut.', '2009-06-27 14:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5546901, 801855, 86447, '<td valign="top">LOL!   Cute.   How in the WORLD did you get this shot posed?  Difficult, I''m sure.  Still, the tail''s details are so lovely, that when I get to his face, I still want to see that detail and it''s a bit washed out.  Advanced editing would have allowed you to dodge/burn his face to accomodate me, I think.  *grin*   (not voting)</td>', 'LOL!   Cute.   How in the WORLD did you get this shot posed?  Difficult, I''m sure.  Still, the tail''s details are so lovely, that when I get to his face, I still want to see that detail and it''s a bit washed out.  Advanced editing would have allowed you to dodge/burn his face to accomodate me, I think.  *grin*   (not voting)', '2009-06-27 14:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5546902, 801835, 86447, '<td valign="top">Without the title, and studying the writing for a long while, I never would have known what this was about and the writing detracted from the image.<br/> <br/>I still think it detracts... Perhaps a bit more DOF would make them a little more readable and make them part of the image instead of something ''in the way''?   (not voting)</td>', 'Without the title, and studying the writing for a long while, I never would have known what this was about and the writing detracted from the image. I still think it detracts... Perhaps a bit more DOF would make them a little more readable and make them part of the image instead of something ''in the way''?   (not voting)', '2009-06-27 14:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5546904, 801407, 86447, '<td valign="top">What a perfectly executed photo!     The thing almost jumps off my monitor at me with that great black background and those wonderful colors.<br/> <br/>The lighting... exquisite!   I hope this is doing well for you.  I wonder if the other clown shot being in the same "Never Seen on DPC" challenge will lower your score.  I hope not. (not voting)</td>', 'What a perfectly executed photo!     The thing almost jumps off my monitor at me with that great black background and those wonderful colors. The lighting... exquisite!   I hope this is doing well for you.  I wonder if the other clown shot being in the same "Never Seen on DPC" challenge will lower your score.  I hope not. (not voting)', '2009-06-27 14:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
