(5547828, 801953, 103142, '<td valign="top">Not voting quite yet, but I''m afraid I''m not understanding why this would fall under "never before seen". We''ve seen a lot of pictures of houses, paths and trees. The shot actually seems quite common on that regard.<br/> <br/>That being said--I wish I came across this photo in a free study or in a different challenge. I like the photo <b>very</b> much. The colors, the feel, the house are all wonderful. I''m afraid it just doesn''t fit this challenge.<br/> <br/>Sorry!</td>', 'Not voting quite yet, but I''m afraid I''m not understanding why this would fall under "never before seen". We''ve seen a lot of pictures of houses, paths and trees. The shot actually seems quite common on that regard. That being said--I wish I came across this photo in a free study or in a different challenge. I like the photo very much. The colors, the feel, the house are all wonderful. I''m afraid it just doesn''t fit this challenge. Sorry!', '2009-06-27 23:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
