(5547846, 802070, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ok, I really didn''t want to look through 13 pages of rainbows to see if there have been any before :) The closest I came was a black and white rainbow. So I''ll give it to you.<br/> <br/>Which is cool, because it''s a wonderful shot! I''d be interested in seeing what it would look like cropped in a little closer... There''s quite a bit of the dark foreground. It probably adds to the shot because of the dark vs. light, but it would be interesting to see it cropped, as well.</td>', 'Ok, I really didn''t want to look through 13 pages of rainbows to see if there have been any before :) The closest I came was a black and white rainbow. So I''ll give it to you. Which is cool, because it''s a wonderful shot! I''d be interested in seeing what it would look like cropped in a little closer... There''s quite a bit of the dark foreground. It probably adds to the shot because of the dark vs. light, but it would be interesting to see it cropped, as well.', '2009-06-27 23:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
