(5547899, 800559, 103142, '<td valign="top">I am completely and totally floored that this hasn''t been done before. I wanted to do my nightmare shot in a cemetery, <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=783932" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1022/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_783932.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1022/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_783932.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1022/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_783932.jpg"/></a> but my husband was already thinking it was creepy, so I just did it inside the house instead.  <br/> <br/>I just searched through ghost, cemetery and graveyard shots and couldn''t find a one! Good thinking -- and good noticing that it hadn''t been done! (and cool shot as well -- I like the horizon tilt).<br/> <br/>Good luck!</td>', 'I am completely and totally floored that this hasn''t been done before. I wanted to do my nightmare shot in a cemetery,  but my husband was already thinking it was creepy, so I just did it inside the house instead.   I just searched through ghost, cemetery and graveyard shots and couldn''t find a one! Good thinking -- and good noticing that it hadn''t been done! (and cool shot as well -- I like the horizon tilt). Good luck!', '2009-06-27 23:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
