(5551585, 802030, 52130, '<td valign="top">I like the focus (although I''m not sure what I''m looking at) but I feel like it could have been composed in a different way to make it a stronger image</td>', 'I like the focus (although I''m not sure what I''m looking at) but I feel like it could have been composed in a different way to make it a stronger image', '2009-06-30 21:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
