(5551587, 802078, 52130, '<td valign="top">not really any composition here, I think a little more time spent on that along  with some more processing (there are green and blue shades in the buck''s hair) would have made this stand out more</td>', 'not really any composition here, I think a little more time spent on that along  with some more processing (there are green and blue shades in the buck''s hair) would have made this stand out more', '2009-06-30 21:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
