(5551592, 802068, 52130, '<td valign="top">hmm, interesting but the technical aspects aren''t looking too strong here, mostly because of the blown out sky and the edges of the rock being cut off. I agree that it''s never been seen on here before but I wonder what it would have looked like from a different perspective.</td>', 'hmm, interesting but the technical aspects aren''t looking too strong here, mostly because of the blown out sky and the edges of the rock being cut off. I agree that it''s never been seen on here before but I wonder what it would have looked like from a different perspective.', '2009-06-30 21:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5551594, 801544, 52130, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I''ve actually seen this many times in real life, but less so on this Site. Cute though :)</td>', 'Hmm, I''ve actually seen this many times in real life, but less so on this Site. Cute though :)', '2009-06-30 21:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5551595, 800950, 52130, '<td valign="top">not too much to look at here. meh</td>', 'not too much to look at here. meh', '2009-06-30 21:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5551596, 800907, 52130, '<td valign="top">it''s well done, but I''ve seen veggies/fruits splashing in water more times than I can count</td>', 'it''s well done, but I''ve seen veggies/fruits splashing in water more times than I can count', '2009-06-30 21:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5551597, 802067, 52130, '<td valign="top">very strange that this was shot on a white sheet but there is a magenta colored shadow. It makes me wonder what kind of light you shot in. I think overall there could have been more effort given here. Yes, no one has seen your grandmother''s triangle pot, but no one has seen my armpit in a challenge either. The idea just isn''t strong enough, and I think by adding a tilt, you were trying to compensate for that, which I don''t think worked. You could have made this into a lovely still life with more dramatic lighting and the pot being the main subject and I would have given it a high score. This is just kinda "meh"</td>', 'very strange that this was shot on a white sheet but there is a magenta colored shadow. It makes me wonder what kind of light you shot in. I think overall there could have been more effort given here. Yes, no one has seen your grandmother''s triangle pot, but no one has seen my armpit in a challenge either. The idea just isn''t strong enough, and I think by adding a tilt, you were trying to compensate for that, which I don''t think worked. You could have made this into a lovely still life with more dramatic lighting and the pot being the main subject and I would have given it a high score. This is just kinda "meh"', '2009-06-30 21:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5551598, 800835, 52130, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this a lot on here, but I''m not sure with a light bulb so I will consider your score once I investigate a little more. Aside from the that, the color and focus is very good.</td>', 'I''ve seen this a lot on here, but I''m not sure with a light bulb so I will consider your score once I investigate a little more. Aside from the that, the color and focus is very good.', '2009-06-30 21:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
