(5555425, 802080, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea, it seems a little soft...? did you try it from a lower angle? The shadow is interesting, but it takes over the shot. Still pretty cool, though!</td>', 'I really like the idea, it seems a little soft...? did you try it from a lower angle? The shadow is interesting, but it takes over the shot. Still pretty cool, though!', '2009-07-02 11:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5555440, 802034, 103142, '<td valign="top">haha! I''ve never seen a ghost cow before! (I wonder if I can do a ghost bluebird...?)<br/> <br/>I actually find this shot very interesting. I don''t think the right 1/3 helps much, though. I draws my eye, and I want to look at the cow.<br/> <br/>Man my tastes have evolved since playing on this site -- it would have been a 3 before, now it''s a 7!</td>', 'haha! I''ve never seen a ghost cow before! (I wonder if I can do a ghost bluebird...?) I actually find this shot very interesting. I don''t think the right 1/3 helps much, though. I draws my eye, and I want to look at the cow. Man my tastes have evolved since playing on this site -- it would have been a 3 before, now it''s a 7!', '2009-07-02 12:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5555461, 801959, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ok, I''m so glad that I didn''t find anything like this in my search!<br/> <br/>This is one of my favorites! Technically it could be better -- seems dark, although, in a way, it adds to the feel. But it is extremely entertaining! imo, a photo doesn''t have to be perfect to score well -- 9!</td>', 'Ok, I''m so glad that I didn''t find anything like this in my search! This is one of my favorites! Technically it could be better -- seems dark, although, in a way, it adds to the feel. But it is extremely entertaining! imo, a photo doesn''t have to be perfect to score well -- 9!', '2009-07-02 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5555467, 801479, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot! I like it a lot--so far it''s the best (though I loved the trolls... :)<br/> <br/>Can''t help but nitpick, though. I would have liked it much better without the shadow of the teapot. (some sort of non-reflective surface, instead), the shadow detracts, imo. - 8</td>', 'Very nice shot! I like it a lot--so far it''s the best (though I loved the trolls... :) Can''t help but nitpick, though. I would have liked it much better without the shadow of the teapot. (some sort of non-reflective surface, instead), the shadow detracts, imo. - 8', '2009-07-02 12:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5555469, 801781, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to tell whether an abstract has been done before, since they''re all very different -- so I can only go by what I see. There are some interesting parts, I like the grain and the lines in the upper left, but the rest doesn''t hold much interest, imo. sorry!</td>', 'It''s hard to tell whether an abstract has been done before, since they''re all very different -- so I can only go by what I see. There are some interesting parts, I like the grain and the lines in the upper left, but the rest doesn''t hold much interest, imo. sorry!', '2009-07-02 12:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
