(5556210, 801326, 103142, '<td valign="top">ok, what are the chances of two hanging fish head pictures in the same Never been Seen Before challenge?!<br/> <br/>anyway, they have been done before <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=659527" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/827/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_659527.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/827/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_659527.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/827/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_659527.jpg"/></a> although your shot is very cool and very creepy!!</td>', 'ok, what are the chances of two hanging fish head pictures in the same Never been Seen Before challenge?! anyway, they have been done before  although your shot is very cool and very creepy!!', '2009-07-02 18:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556211, 801151, 103142, '<td valign="top">Not sure whether this has been done before. I like the idea a lot, but the front face is very distracting... Could you crop off about 1/3 of the left side of her face and get the same idea, but not as overwhelming? Just a thought...</td>', 'Not sure whether this has been done before. I like the idea a lot, but the front face is very distracting... Could you crop off about 1/3 of the left side of her face and get the same idea, but not as overwhelming? Just a thought...', '2009-07-02 18:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556215, 800877, 48546, '<td valign="top">Hey, I still have that camera.</td>', 'Hey, I still have that camera.', '2009-07-02 18:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556216, 801994, 103142, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot--didn''t think that it was unique, (I remember some suitcase photos.) but a search on luggage or suitcases didn''t show anything like it.<br/> <br/>Good job! (8)<br/> <br/>oh come on!! Now it''s been seen! you entered a similar one in grain... Now what do I do? You should have at least switched them around a little...</td>', 'wonderful shot--didn''t think that it was unique, (I remember some suitcase photos.) but a search on luggage or suitcases didn''t show anything like it. Good job! (8) oh come on!! Now it''s been seen! you entered a similar one in grain... Now what do I do? You should have at least switched them around a little...', '2009-07-02 18:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556233, 801953, 105171, '<td valign="top">Extremely well done!  What a picture.  Seems to real.</td>', 'Extremely well done!  What a picture.  Seems to real.', '2009-07-02 18:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556240, 800789, 105171, '<td valign="top">Never seen anything like that!  Great shot and nice DOF.</td>', 'Never seen anything like that!  Great shot and nice DOF.', '2009-07-02 18:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556255, 801940, 105171, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, vibrant colors.</td>', 'Very nice shot, vibrant colors.', '2009-07-02 18:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556256, 801294, 105171, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF.  Great shot.  BW gives dramatic effect.</td>', 'Nice use of DOF.  Great shot.  BW gives dramatic effect.', '2009-07-02 18:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556268, 802071, 105171, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and vibrant colors, but have seen clowns before in DPC.</td>', 'Nice shot and vibrant colors, but have seen clowns before in DPC.', '2009-07-02 18:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556574, 802123, 31664, '<td valign="top">Well that has never been seen on DPC before I''ll give you that.  Great shot with a little cringe factor, love the balloon it tops it of nicely.  hope the prude factor doesn''t knock you down too much!</td>', 'Well that has never been seen on DPC before I''ll give you that.  Great shot with a little cringe factor, love the balloon it tops it of nicely.  hope the prude factor doesn''t knock you down too much!', '2009-07-02 20:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556587, 801968, 31664, '<td valign="top">Is it light painting inverted?  Interesting shot,  definitely fits the theme.</td>', 'Is it light painting inverted?  Interesting shot,  definitely fits the theme.', '2009-07-02 20:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556588, 802131, 31664, '<td valign="top">hahahahaahh.  A cleaver pun,  well at least rare on DPC :)</td>', 'hahahahaahh.  A cleaver pun,  well at least rare on DPC :)', '2009-07-02 20:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556814, 801964, 77196, '<td valign="top">Took me forever to figure out what this was. You''ve cropped it close enough on the top that you miss the arch, and it almost looks like a painting with a downward swoosh above a short rock wall.</td>', 'Took me forever to figure out what this was. You''ve cropped it close enough on the top that you miss the arch, and it almost looks like a painting with a downward swoosh above a short rock wall.', '2009-07-02 22:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556820, 801877, 77196, '<td valign="top">The pendants and fence in the foreground detract from the pigs. Cute ad / title.</td>', 'The pendants and fence in the foreground detract from the pigs. Cute ad / title.', '2009-07-02 22:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556829, 802082, 77196, '<td valign="top">A backlit shag carpet? Nice editing / effect.</td>', 'A backlit shag carpet? Nice editing / effect.', '2009-07-02 22:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557075, 802099, 32011, '<td valign="top">I''m putting my money on this one getting the blue ribbon.  My favourite by far.  I can look it for ages... the detail and the story is just enthralling... only think stopping me from giving it a 10 was the blurriness at the bottom right of the image.  Well done.</td>', 'I''m putting my money on this one getting the blue ribbon.  My favourite by far.  I can look it for ages... the detail and the story is just enthralling... only think stopping me from giving it a 10 was the blurriness at the bottom right of the image.  Well done.', '2009-07-03 00:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557088, 801871, 32011, '<td valign="top">I love this image.  Just looking at it, you''re forced to wonder what it the significance of the graffiti, and then you notice what looked to be foreign characters are in fact English letters, and it really is just "graffiti".  Excellent photo and should do well.</td>', 'I love this image.  Just looking at it, you''re forced to wonder what it the significance of the graffiti, and then you notice what looked to be foreign characters are in fact English letters, and it really is just "graffiti".  Excellent photo and should do well.', '2009-07-03 00:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557097, 801877, 50641, '<td valign="top">do they swim?  the ones at our state fair are paddling porkers!</td>', 'do they swim?  the ones at our state fair are paddling porkers!', '2009-07-03 00:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557100, 800924, 57460, '<td valign="top">I have looked at this photo multiple times, but this is the first time I''ve noticed they are on roller blades!  Looks like fun!  Good shot!</td>', 'I have looked at this photo multiple times, but this is the first time I''ve noticed they are on roller blades!  Looks like fun!  Good shot!', '2009-07-03 00:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
