(5557130, 802124, 57460, '<td valign="top">I like your concept with this photo.  I love the lighting.  The lines on the arm are a little distracting, but other than that - very well done!  Great job!</td>', 'I like your concept with this photo.  I love the lighting.  The lines on the arm are a little distracting, but other than that - very well done!  Great job!', '2009-07-03 00:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
