(5557135, 801781, 50695, '<td valign="top">Loud and disorienting, like Billie Jean.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon. <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/> <br/> <br/>Someone should really give you some competition.</td>', 'Loud and disorienting, like Billie Jean. Posthumous Red Ribbon.   Someone should really give you some competition.', '2009-07-03 00:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557140, 801950, 50695, '<td valign="top">Alarming, and not something I''ve seen before. posthumous yellow ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Alarming, and not something I''ve seen before. posthumous yellow ribbon. ', '2009-07-03 00:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557142, 800950, 50695, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. 9</td>', 'Gorgeous. 9', '2009-07-03 00:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557143, 800754, 57460, '<td valign="top">I am not sure if I completely get the connection between your title and the photo - is it because of the barb wire or fence?  I see a lot of flower photos here, so I am sure your intent must have been to due with what is supposed to be ''unusual'' - I will have to come back to read your comments to see your intent on this one.  Other than all of that - I like the rain drops on the flower and the fence, and I like the DOF.  Good job.</td>', 'I am not sure if I completely get the connection between your title and the photo - is it because of the barb wire or fence?  I see a lot of flower photos here, so I am sure your intent must have been to due with what is supposed to be ''unusual'' - I will have to come back to read your comments to see your intent on this one.  Other than all of that - I like the rain drops on the flower and the fence, and I like the DOF.  Good job.', '2009-07-03 00:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557144, 800559, 50695, '<td valign="top">Creepy horrible wonderful. 9</td>', 'Creepy horrible wonderful. 9', '2009-07-03 00:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557145, 800924, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m giving you a 10 just for brightening up my world.</td>', 'I''m giving you a 10 just for brightening up my world.', '2009-07-03 00:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557148, 802123, 50695, '<td valign="top">Daring, provocative, resonant. 9</td>', 'Daring, provocative, resonant. 9', '2009-07-03 00:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
