(5557181, 801250, 57460, '<td valign="top">Ha!  That looks interesting!  But why is there a screened outhouse?  To get a breeze while doing business?  The sky is a little bright - maybe using a polarizing filter would have helped, or a gradient layer in PP to help tone down the sky?  Good job though!</td>', 'Ha!  That looks interesting!  But why is there a screened outhouse?  To get a breeze while doing business?  The sky is a little bright - maybe using a polarizing filter would have helped, or a gradient layer in PP to help tone down the sky?  Good job though!', '2009-07-03 00:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557183, 801877, 57460, '<td valign="top">The one on the left almost looks like his ears are horns! lol! Cute photo - but I almost feel bad for the poor piggies!</td>', 'The one on the left almost looks like his ears are horns! lol! Cute photo - but I almost feel bad for the poor piggies!', '2009-07-03 00:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557184, 801889, 81213, '<td valign="top">The editing has destroyed the natural qualities of the image, this can be doe well, or it can butcher color photography. Im going to say this does neither, it''s creative in all aspect (including the title) and demonstrates a great sense of humor. I love the ummm... uhh... change of mood but it lacks photographic qualities. Maybe letting us see a little sky would help?</td>', 'The editing has destroyed the natural qualities of the image, this can be doe well, or it can butcher color photography. Im going to say this does neither, it''s creative in all aspect (including the title) and demonstrates a great sense of humor. I love the ummm... uhh... change of mood but it lacks photographic qualities. Maybe letting us see a little sky would help?', '2009-07-03 00:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557186, 801763, 57460, '<td valign="top">I have seen clouds here before - but looking at your title, I get where you are going with it.  Interesting take on the challenge.  I do like the red/pink hues in the clouds.  Good job!</td>', 'I have seen clouds here before - but looking at your title, I get where you are going with it.  Interesting take on the challenge.  I do like the red/pink hues in the clouds.  Good job!', '2009-07-03 00:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557189, 802043, 57460, '<td valign="top">Very unique photo - I would have never known what it was without your title.  Very abstract and interesting.  It does feel as though it is missing something.</td>', 'Very unique photo - I would have never known what it was without your title.  Very abstract and interesting.  It does feel as though it is missing something.', '2009-07-03 00:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557197, 802082, 50641, '<td valign="top">yes, they are!  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=291738" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/444/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_291738.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/444/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_291738.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/444/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_291738.jpg"/></a></td>', 'yes, they are!  ', '2009-07-03 00:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557199, 801544, 57460, '<td valign="top">Yummy!  Everyone loves Pizza!  Even the seagulls!  He looks like he is enjoying it!  Good capture!</td>', 'Yummy!  Everyone loves Pizza!  Even the seagulls!  He looks like he is enjoying it!  Good capture!', '2009-07-03 00:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557203, 800768, 50641, '<td valign="top">hey e!  nice one. (cute guy too)</td>', 'hey e!  nice one. (cute guy too)', '2009-07-03 00:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557206, 801668, 57460, '<td valign="top">This is interesting.  I think it fits the challenge well, since I don''t think I have seen this before - but I am not so sure I am a fan on the post processing.  And maybe there is a little too much negative space at the top of the photo.</td>', 'This is interesting.  I think it fits the challenge well, since I don''t think I have seen this before - but I am not so sure I am a fan on the post processing.  And maybe there is a little too much negative space at the top of the photo.', '2009-07-03 00:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557209, 801410, 50641, '<td valign="top">ok, that''s a new kind of bra, i''ll take your word on the support</td>', 'ok, that''s a new kind of bra, i''ll take your word on the support', '2009-07-03 00:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557211, 800835, 50641, '<td valign="top">hey it''s a person not an acronym...</td>', 'hey it''s a person not an acronym...', '2009-07-03 00:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557212, 801407, 57460, '<td valign="top">uhh... Clowns are creepy - even the bobble head kind!  This is an interesting take on the challenge - but I feel it could use a little more - maybe capturing some motion in his head would have added a little more interest.  Good job though!</td>', 'uhh... Clowns are creepy - even the bobble head kind!  This is an interesting take on the challenge - but I feel it could use a little more - maybe capturing some motion in his head would have added a little more interest.  Good job though!', '2009-07-03 00:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
