(5560797, 800800, 18144, '<td valign="top">Sorry your photo was DQ''d.<br/> <br/>Very powerful image.  Her eye''s tell her story.  However, IMO the hi-key takes away from the look of a person battling the invader.  My wife (BC) and I (CC) both battled the invader and lost our nature skin coloring.  We became pale with a grayish skin tone. In my DP portfolio there is an image of me receiving chemo.  Images of people dealing with cancer disturb me, even my own image does.  <br/> <br/>I hope your friend overcomes the invader. When she does, and I know she will, she will become a stronger person.<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Sorry your photo was DQ''d. Very powerful image.  Her eye''s tell her story.  However, IMO the hi-key takes away from the look of a person battling the invader.  My wife (BC) and I (CC) both battled the invader and lost our nature skin coloring.  We became pale with a grayish skin tone. In my DP portfolio there is an image of me receiving chemo.  Images of people dealing with cancer disturb me, even my own image does.   I hope your friend overcomes the invader. When she does, and I know she will, she will become a stronger person.   ', '2009-07-05 20:38:16.000000', NULL, 0),
