(5567547, 801326, 31637, '<td valign="top">Hello, found this in the Critique Club section:<br/> <br/>Upon first glance, I get thrown off by the repulsive look of the fish heads. It''s a good thing though, it means it has very good impact! I had to immediately read your details to find out more about them. As for fitting the challenge, it definitely does, although not the rarest of photos. <br/> <br/>Your title is ok; maybe a bit over dramatized. Extra Terrestrial doesn''t mean alien, but I guess it fits. The composition is good and B/W was a great choice for this. The Shallow DOF makes sense in this case since all subjects are the same and your background is very hard to make out; cant tell if they are in a bottle or hanging, almost giving this an abstract feel. <br/> <br/>All in all, good impressionism, not something I would print and hang up in my kitchen for sure, but a good study. I''m sure fish heads are very good for you!<br/> <br/>I would vote between 5 and 6.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hello, found this in the Critique Club section: Upon first glance, I get thrown off by the repulsive look of the fish heads. It''s a good thing though, it means it has very good impact! I had to immediately read your details to find out more about them. As for fitting the challenge, it definitely does, although not the rarest of photos.  Your title is ok; maybe a bit over dramatized. Extra Terrestrial doesn''t mean alien, but I guess it fits. The composition is good and B/W was a great choice for this. The Shallow DOF makes sense in this case since all subjects are the same and your background is very hard to make out; cant tell if they are in a bottle or hanging, almost giving this an abstract feel.  All in all, good impressionism, not something I would print and hang up in my kitchen for sure, but a good study. I''m sure fish heads are very good for you! I would vote between 5 and 6. ', '2009-07-10 00:35:57.000000', NULL, 0),
