(5579996, 800789, 66515, '<td valign="top">Its never fun getting dumped on your head. Especially when you are riding a horse that''s supposed to be broke. I got tossed one spring while out on a ride and fractured the vertebrae at the base of my skull. If I hit a little harder I wouldn''t be around today to submit to DPC. <br/> <br/>Interesting processing. Usually for these type of the images they tend to be presented "straight up". I like this though. My only complaint (and its a small one) is that the horse look especially shiny. The image appears a little angled but I think it adds to the action. <br/> <br/>You captured the action perfectly though I am not sure she''d like to have a print. ;) <br/> <br/>In any event, great capture and I hope that she is doing well.</td>', 'Its never fun getting dumped on your head. Especially when you are riding a horse that''s supposed to be broke. I got tossed one spring while out on a ride and fractured the vertebrae at the base of my skull. If I hit a little harder I wouldn''t be around today to submit to DPC.  Interesting processing. Usually for these type of the images they tend to be presented "straight up". I like this though. My only complaint (and its a small one) is that the horse look especially shiny. The image appears a little angled but I think it adds to the action.  You captured the action perfectly though I am not sure she''d like to have a print. ;)  In any event, great capture and I hope that she is doing well.', '2009-07-20 02:36:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5586586, 801774, 87808, '<td valign="top">A. I think you need to change brother<br/>B. I hope you got him something just as fun<br/>C. umm, have to come back on that one<br/>D. I really was hoping you wouldnt stick this one in the pile (hah pile haha groan)<br/> <br/>it is too shiny, sticking a light underneath it would have brought out the amber tones that I think are lurking there (Dear Lordy how do you comment on poop)<br/> <br/>get rid of the paper, i think having it on a higher plane would have worked with the angle here.  As with most fossils, there are solid pieces (shoot me now), so the brown/amber colour would only enhance these lumps.</td>', 'A. I think you need to change brotherB. I hope you got him something just as funC. umm, have to come back on that oneD. I really was hoping you wouldnt stick this one in the pile (hah pile haha groan) it is too shiny, sticking a light underneath it would have brought out the amber tones that I think are lurking there (Dear Lordy how do you comment on poop) get rid of the paper, i think having it on a higher plane would have worked with the angle here.  As with most fossils, there are solid pieces (shoot me now), so the brown/amber colour would only enhance these lumps.', '2009-07-26 11:04:22.000000', NULL, 0),
