(6041621, 801974, 37845, '<td valign="top">Why is this in my favourites?<br/> <br/>I like the imagary that this photo puts into the viewers mind. The title ''Death of a pigeon'', and all the flattened grass suggest that there was a drawn out struggle, and that the pigeon didnt go easy. Very few shots are able to capture that action without being gratuitous or violent. Its one of my favs because it is unique, and powerful. <br/> <br/>B</td>', 'Why is this in my favourites? I like the imagary that this photo puts into the viewers mind. The title ''Death of a pigeon'', and all the flattened grass suggest that there was a drawn out struggle, and that the pigeon didnt go easy. Very few shots are able to capture that action without being gratuitous or violent. Its one of my favs because it is unique, and powerful.  B', '2010-06-05 03:34:44.000000', NULL, 0),
